<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, position: 'relative', overflow: 'hidden', background: '#0B1120', fontFamily: '微软雅黑' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 110, paddingLeft: 64, paddingRight: 64, paddingTop: 34, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 18 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 34, background: '#38BDF8' }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 700, color: '#F8FAFC', letterSpacing: 0.5 }}>能力四 · 查得到</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.42)', marginTop: 8 }}>设备说明书，问啥答啥</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 546, paddingLeft: 64, paddingRight: 64, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 48 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 500, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <Box style={{ background: '#16223A', border: '1px solid rgba(248,250,252,0.10)', borderRadius: 10, padding: '26px 26px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#38BDF8', letterSpacing: 2, fontWeight: 700 }}>场景</Text>
                <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.06)', borderRadius: 8, padding: '14px 18px', marginTop: 18 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.75)' }}>你问：「空调过滤网多久洗一次？」</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.50)', textAlign: 'center', marginTop: 14, marginBottom: 14 }}>↓</Text>
                <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(56,189,248,0.10)', borderRadius: 8, padding: '14px 18px' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#F8FAFC' }}>它从你导入的说明书里召回答案</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.55)', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 18 }}>
                    哪怕你问"过滤网"、原文写"滤网"，<br />
                    字面不重合，语义也能对上。
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 620, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <Box style={{ background: '#16223A', border: '1px solid rgba(56,189,248,0.22)', borderRadius: 10, padding: '20px 24px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#38BDF8', fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontWeight: 700, letterSpacing: 1 }}>决策 1</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 700, color: '#F8FAFC', marginTop: 8 }}>知识库从"内置 5 条"变成"用户可导入"</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.58)', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 8 }}>内置的通用常识当兜底，你自己家的说明书自己导——按家庭隔离，互不串。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ background: '#16223A', border: '1px solid rgba(56,189,248,0.22)', borderRadius: 10, padding: '20px 24px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#38BDF8', fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontWeight: 700, letterSpacing: 1 }}>决策 2</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 700, color: '#F8FAFC', marginTop: 8 }}>语义召回，不是字面匹配</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.58)', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 8 }}>本地 embedding 把语义相近的段落找出来，字面零重合也能中。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ background: '#16223A', border: '1px solid rgba(56,189,248,0.22)', borderRadius: 10, padding: '20px 24px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#38BDF8', fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontWeight: 700, letterSpacing: 1 }}>决策 3</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 700, color: '#F8FAFC', marginTop: 8 }}>查不到就说查不到</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.58)', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 8 }}>低相关的段落被阈值过滤掉，不硬编——宁可说"没查到"，不给你驴唇不对马嘴的答案。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 64, paddingLeft: 64, paddingRight: 64, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.40)' }}>HomeMind · 智能家居 AI 管家</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.40)', fontFamily: 'Consolas' }}>10 / 15</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
